  "Description": "Displaces the image in time: each pixel is taken from a different recent frame, selected by the brightness of a displacement map.\n\nThe incoming frames are kept in a texture array history buffer. Many inputs inherited from [Displace] currently have no effect.\n\nAKA: slitscan, timewarp, echo\n\nSee also: [Displace], [AfterGlow2]",
